	('95a90997-37d0-4684-967e-598646bcce1c', '2026-08-27 12:58:59.289094+00', 'Robotics Society', 'The Talk Show', 'Fun Talk Shows', 2, 'CTz9_CvyKUOYmGuCLeRR-5Q', 'https://www.youtube.com/@MakrXorg', 'kVTtIz78_K4', '{"week": 1, "brief": "<p>The next decade belongs to the innovators. We want to see your vision of the future!</p><p><strong>Your Task:</strong></p><p>Create a picture, a digital art piece, or a short video that captures what you imagine the world will look like in the next 10 years.</p><p>Once you''re done, show us your work:</p><p>1. Post your creation as an <strong>Instagram Story</strong>.</p><p>2. Tag <strong>@robotics.society and @makrxorg</strong> so we can see it!</p><p>We''ll be featuring our favorite submissions live on the next episode!</p><p></p>", "title": "Imagine the Future 🚀", "deadline": "Sunday, 11:59 PM"}', '[]');
